        "@value": "This minor head will be divided into the following sub heads: The sub head \"Surcharge\" will record receipts on account of surcharge levied under the Sale Tax Act .The subhead \"Other Receipts\" will record miscellaneous receipts such as penalty, fines etc, in the administration of the Tax laws."
      }
    ]
  },
