      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This head will be sub- divided into :- For sub-heads (i) and (ii) please see note on Sub-head (l) and (m) below Note (3) below the major head \"8658-Suspense Accounts\". Sub-head (iii) will be operated where NDF collections appear as deductions from salary bills etc. of Government servants. This head will be cleared by issue of Cheques / Bank Drafts in favour of the Reserve Bank of India."
