      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The minor heads will be divided into the following sub-heads: The sub-head \"Other Receipts\" will record miscellaneous receipts like penalties, fine etc. in the administration of the relevant Acts/Regulations."
      }
    ]
  },
