      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Horticulture and Vegetable Crops"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This minor head will include expenditure on schemes relating to fruits, vegetables, Nurseries, Kitchen gardens and Orchards, and suitable sub-heads for individual scheme or a group of schemes may be opened, with appropriate grouping under \"Fruits\", \"Vegetables\" and \"Nursery\". It will, however, exclude expenditure on forest nursery' which will be recorded under the major head '2406 Forestry and Wild life.'"
