      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This head is intended as a \"Personal Deposit\" for accommodating receipt on account of interest on the securities held by the Accountants General and other Government Officers acting as Treasurers of Charitable Endowments under the Charitable Endowments Act, and also for making payment of arrears of interest etc. from out of the accretions and balances lying at the credit of this head."
