        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(a) Each Milk Supply scheme which has been declared as commercial will be treated as a minor head and will have the following sub-heads with suitable detailed heads thereunder, as may be found necessary, viz:- (b) Milk Supply Schemes which are not declared as commercial will however be treated as sub-head below the Minor Head “Diary Development Projects”."
