      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "These minor heads will have the following sub-heads with suitable detailed heads thereunder: - Working Expenses- Management Purchase of Opium Repairs and Maintenance Buildings Machinery and Equipment Suspense Transfer to Depreciation Reserve Fund Other expenditure Deduct-Value of Opium transferred to Alkaloid Works The sub-head \"Other expenditure\" will include pensions / gratuities and interest on capital and contributions to Funds. The sub-head \"Management\" will include proportionate expenditure of Bureau of Narcotics recorded under the minor head \"Narcotics Control\" below the major head \"2070-Other Administrative Services\"."
      }
    ]
  },
